{"4623580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Purgatory Shift", "steam_appid": 4623580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4759560], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in loop of the afterlife. Your job is judging souls, playing slots, and your only hope for freedom lies behind the elevator doors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623580/extras/0926bba4155e9e362b03f1bae08a6651.poster.avif?t=1786476773\" width=500 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623580/extras/0926bba4155e9e362b03f1bae08a6651.webm?t=1786476773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623580/extras/0926bba4155e9e362b03f1bae08a6651.mp4?t=1786476773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​<strong>Judge Souls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is to judge souls. Read the list of their deeds and pass the verdict. Avoid mistakes, and remember: time is running out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623580/extras/b249a6a7de5e67b53c1a990a3760cfa1.poster.avif?t=1786476773\" width=500 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623580/extras/b249a6a7de5e67b53c1a990a3760cfa1.webm?t=1786476773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623580/extras/b249a6a7de5e67b53c1a990a3760cfa1.mp4?t=1786476773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​<strong>Push Your Luck</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed your hard-earned coins into the slot machines. Will you hit the jackpot, or lose it all once again?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​<strong>Buy Upgrades</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase extra lives and items to help you survive the deadly test levels... not that they'll help you anyway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623580/extras/852ce843f396895cd5147e26b296724e.poster.avif?t=1786476773\" width=500 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623580/extras/852ce843f396895cd5147e26b296724e.webm?t=1786476773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623580/extras/852ce843f396895cd5147e26b296724e.mp4?t=1786476773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​<strong>Try to Escape</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the obstacle courses and find the items needed to activate the elevator and break free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​Will you find a way to escape or will you just rage-quit first?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in loop of the afterlife. Your job is judging souls, playing slots, and your only hope for freedom lies behind the elevator doors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623580/extras/0926bba4155e9e362b03f1bae08a6651.poster.avif?t=1786476773\" width=500 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623580/extras/0926bba4155e9e362b03f1bae08a6651.webm?t=1786476773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623580/extras/0926bba4155e9e362b03f1ba