_paragraph\" >​<strong>Try to Escape</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the obstacle courses and find the items needed to activate the elevator and break free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​Will you find a way to escape or will you just rage-quit first?</p>", "short_description": "This game was made just to break you. Fake floors, invisible traps, and randomly changing rules. Buy it, play it, hate it.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623580/14aa8c7fade07f9e83914ea33d967a26a02b558f/header.jpg?t=1786476773", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623580/828055bc5fe6159690be5c08e48749b7aeb1dacf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786476773", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4623580/828055bc5fe6159690be5c08e48749b7aeb1dacf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786476773", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600K / AMD Ryzen 5 1600 <br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 (6GB) / AMD Radeon RX 580 <br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Null Loop Interactive"], "publishers": ["Null Loop interactive"], "demos": [{"appid": 4759560, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 15, "description": "Stats"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "h